87
00:16:36,892 --> 00:16:43,732
Lonely ロリロリ神 降臨 (ずっきゅーん!) 鐘を鳴らせばこの通り (Yes!) とても優しくて
Lonely Loli Loli God descends! (Zukkyun!) If you ring the bell, it's just like this—(Yes!) Such a gentle,

88
