wonderful big brother!

118
00:19:21,882 --> 00:19:27,462
楽園でホラねんねしな
Now go right to sleep in paradise.

119
00:19:27,942 --> 00:19:34,872
それが救済のレクイエム
That is the requiem of salvation.

120
00:19:37,712 --> 00:19:40,642
触ったら逮捕! (Ah!) 極Chu de 点呼! (Uh!) いちにーさんしー?
Touched? Arrested! (Ah!) Roll call in KyokuChu! (Uh!) One, two, three, four?

121
00:19:43,642 --> 00:19:50,272
(ごめんなさーい!) ハァ? ごめんなさいが聞こえなーい 粛聖! ロリ神レクイエム☆
(We're sorry!) Huh? I can't hear your "I'm sorry"! Purge! Loli God Requiem☆

122
00:19:51,272 --> 00:19:53,742
ほんっとーに きもちわるい
Truly creepy.

123
00:20:13,777 --> 00:20:19,077
[Title: こちら、幸福安心委員会です。 作詩:鳥居羊 作曲:うたたP]
[Title: Here We Are, The Happy and Peaceful Safety Committee. Lyrics: Torii Hitsuji, Music: Utata-P]

124
00:20:50,589 --> 00:20:57,399
どうして みんなが 幸せなの？ この世界のこと 聞きたいって、知りたいって
Why is everyone so happy? Wanting to hear about this world, wanting to know...

125
00:20:57,899 --> 00:21:05,489
水辺の公園で みんなが耳を澄ませて わくわくするね ねぇ、オンディーヌ？
Everyone is straining their ears at the waterside park, feeling so excited... right, Ondine?

126
00:21:21,097 --> 00:21:24,057
ハイ！ ハイ！
Hey! Hey!

127
00:21:24,667 --> 00:21:34,597
さあさあ、みなさん 教えてあげまーす！ みんなが気になっていること 疑問に思ってること ぜーんぶ 教えてあげまーす！
Come on everyone, I'll tell you! Everything you're curious about, everything you're wondering—I'll tell you all of it!

128
00:21:35,587 --> 00:21:43,127
えー、みなさんが 幸福なのは… 義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ？ 果たしてますか？
Yes, being happy is your obligation. Are you happy? It's your duty! Are you fulfilling it?

129
00:21:44,007 --> 00:21:50,407
我々、幸福安心委員会は みなさまの幸せを願い そして、支えまーす！
We, the Happy and Peaceful Safety Committee, pray for your happiness and support you!

130
00:21:51,087 --> 00:21:57,707
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！ 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ！
Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty! Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty!

131
00:22:06,567 --> 00:22:16,057
ですから、安心して義務を果たすように！ みなさまの幸せが 我々の幸せ 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ？ 果たしてますか？
Therefore, rest assured and fulfill your duty. Your happiness is our happiness. Are you happy? It's your duty! Are you fulfilling it?

132
00:22:16,777 --> 00:22:19,577
幸せじゃないなら…
If you're not happy...

133
00:22:20,027 --> 00:22:28,627
絞首 斬首 銃殺 釜ゆで 溺死 電気 火あぶり 生き埋め 薬殺 石打ち 鋸 はりつけ 好きなのを 選んでね
Hanging, decapitation, firing squad, boiling alive, drowning, electrocution, burning at the stake, burying alive, lethal injection, stoning, sawing, crucifixion. Pick whichever you like!

134
00:22:29,427 --> 00:22:32,427
ハイ！ ハイ！
Hey! Hey!

135
00:22:32,827 --> 00:22:38,127
さあさあ、みなさん 幸せだけが満ちてまーす！ 不安とか不満、なにひとつないでしょー？
Come on everyone, only happiness fills this place! There's not a single dissatisfaction, right?

136
00:22:39,277 --> 00:22:43,227
コワーイ、恐いわー 幸せすぎて、恐いわー
Scary, so scary... Being too happy is scary!

137
00:23:27,827 --> 00:23:34,677
ホントに みんなが 幸せなの？ この世界の外 行きたいって、逃げたいって
Is everyone truly happy? Wanting to go outside this world, wanting to escape...

138
00:23:39,127 --> 00:23:46,477
水辺の公園で みんなが耳を塞いで ビクビクしてた ねぇ、ウンディーネ？
Everyone is plugging their ears at the waterside park, trembling in fear—right, Undine?

139
00:23:58,827 --> 00:24:01,827
ハイ！ ハイ！
Hey! Hey!

140
00:24:02,227 --> 00:24:06,727
さあさあ、みなさん 死にましたー！ オンディーヌをふった騎士は 死にましたー！
Come on everyone, they died! The knight who dumped Ondine has died!

141
00:24:07,177 --> 00:24:12,777
葬儀に出るなら、向こうに並べ！ それ以外は 幸せに暮らせ！ 以上
If you're attending the funeral, line up over there! Everyone else, live happily! That is all.

142
00:24:13,277 --> 00:24:20,127
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ？
Being happy is an obligation! Being happy is an obligation! Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty!

143
00:24:20,527 --> 00:24:28,277
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せですか？ 義務ですよ
Being happy is an obligation! Being happy is an obligation! Being happy is an obligation! Are you happy? It's your duty.

144
00:24:32,777 --> 00:24:43,527
幸福なのは義務なんです 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸福なのは義務なんです 幸せじゃないなら 死ね
Being happy is an obligation! Being happy is an obligation! Being happy is an obligation! If you're not happy, drop dead!

145
00:25:12,943 --> 00:25:20,763
忘れてしまったことだけを覚えている
I only remember the things I've forgotten...

146
00:25:22,043 --> 00:25:31,683
ぽかりと空いた穴の先で君と出会った
I met you beyond the hollowed-out opening.

147
00:25:31,903 --> 00:25:41,643
名前も顔もわからない君 なんだか懐かしいような気がした
Even though I don't know your name or your face, somehow you felt so nostalgic.

148
00:25:41,923 --> 00:25:52,083
互いに穴埋めていくように ふざけあって 笑いあって
We teased and laughed together, filling in each other's empty spaces.

149
00:25:52,603 --> 00:26:01,783
世界中 ああ 愛のどこかにいる君のため
For you, who are somewhere in this world... ah, within love's embrace,

150
00:26:02,323 --> 00:26:12,463
今 ああ 生きているよ 僕ら 無名のまま
Right now... ah, we are living, the two of us, remaining nameless.

151
00:26:45,283 --> 00:26:53,783
たとえこれが映し出された幻でも
Even if this is just a projected illusion,

152
00:26:55,103 --> 00:27:03,943
確かに感じる今君がそこにいること
I can truly feel that you are right there now.

153
00:27:04,263 --> 00:27:13,983
名前も顔もわからない君 さよならしてしまえば終わりだ
If we were to say goodbye to someone whose name and face we don't know, it would all be over.

154
00:27:14,403 --> 00:27:23,643
君がいなきゃ穴は大きくなる 構わないさ すぐ見つかる
Without you, the emptiness grows larger... but that's fine, it will soon be found.

155
00:27:27,063 --> 00:27:37,183
世界中 ああ 愛のどこかにいる君はどこ？
Where are you, who are somewhere in this world... ah, within love's embrace?

156
00:27:37,443 --> 00:27:46,983
今 ああ ここにいるよ 私 「無名」
Right now... ah, I am right here, myself... 'Nameless'.

157
00:27:47,583 --> 00:27:56,863
あたりは一面真っ暗な世界 真っ逆さまに落ちていく
Falling headfirst into a world that is pitch black all around...

158
00:27:57,083 --> 00:28:07,383
無名だからこの世界には 忘れられ消えちゃうの それでも君が求めるのなら この胸に空いた穴に今 君から私へ風は通り抜け 一羽の鳥が今君の元へと行く
Because I am nameless, I might be forgotten and vanish from this world... But if you desire it, wind now passes through the hollow in my chest, and a bird flies to your side.

159
00:28:17,323 --> 00:28:27,263
世界中 ああ 愛のどこかにいる君のため
For you, who are somewhere in this world... ah, within love's embrace,

160
00:28:27,403 --> 00:28:37,703
今 ああ 生きていくよ 私 「ムメイ」のまま
Right now... ah, I will keep living... as 'Mumei'.

161
00:30:31,406 --> 00:30:34,086
フェアリーテイルは
The fairy tale

162
00:30:35,246 --> 00:30:38,506
さっき死んだみたい
Seems to have died just now

163
00:30:41,226 --> 00:30:45,326
煉瓦の病棟で
In the brick ward

164
00:30:47,326 --> 00:30:51,046
うまく歌えなくて
Unable to sing well

165
00:30:52,566 --> 00:30:55,666
霧に煙る夜
On a night shrouded in fog

166
00:30:57,566 --> 00:31:01,406
浮かべ赤い月
Floating the red moon

167
00:31:02,826 --> 00:31:05,486
ほらみて 私を
Look at me

168
00:31:08,766 --> 00:31:11,506
目を逸らさないで
Don't look away

169
00:31:14,326 --> 00:31:19,146
黒い鉄格子の中で 私は生まれてきたんだ
Inside the black iron bars, I was born

170
00:31:20,106 --> 00:31:24,766
悪意の代償を願え 望むがままにお前に
Ask for the price of malice, exactly as you wish

171
00:31:25,326 --> 00:31:26,586
さあ与えよう
Come, I shall grant you

172
00:31:26,726 --> 00:31:29,166
正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Justice, destroying it before it is destroyed

173
00:31:29,286 --> 00:31:32,326
因果の代償を払い 共に行こう
Paying the price of cause and effect, let's go together

174
00:31:33,406 --> 00:31:36,046
名前のない怪物
A nameless monster

175
00:31:50,846 --> 00:31:53,526
耳鳴りがしてる
My ears are ringing

176
00:31:55,186 --> 00:31:58,486
鉄条網うるさくって
The barbed wire is so noisy

177
00:32:01,226 --> 00:32:04,006
思い出せないの
I can't remember

178
00:32:06,726 --> 00:32:10,106
あの日の旋律
The melody of that day

179
00:32:12,226 --> 00:32:15,626
雨はまだ止まない
The rain still hasn't stopped

180
00:32:17,886 --> 00:32:20,986
何にも見えないの
I can't see anything at all

181
00:32:23,246 --> 00:32:26,286
ほらみて こんなに
Look, see how much

182
00:32:28,786 --> 00:32:31,126
大きくなったの
It has grown

183
00:32:34,266 --> 00:32:37,186
黒い雨 降らせこの空
Black rain, pour upon this sky

184
00:32:37,346 --> 00:32:39,466
私は望まれないもの
I am an unwanted being

185
00:32:39,986 --> 00:32:42,946
ひび割れたノイローゼ 愛す
Loving the cracked neurosis

186
00:32:43,086 --> 00:32:45,266
同罪の傍観者達に さあ今
To the equally guilty bystanders, come now

187
00:32:45,486 --> 00:32:47,846
ふるえ正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Trembling justice, destroying it before it is destroyed

188
00:32:47,986 --> 00:32:50,526
因果の代償を払い 共に行こう
Paying the price of cause and effect, let's go together

189
00:32:55,486 --> 00:33:00,026
名前のない怪物
A nameless monster

190
00:33:17,286 --> 00:33:20,106
ああ
Ah...

191
00:33:20,443 --> 00:33:23,883
神は告げる
God proclaims

192
00:33:29,906 --> 00:33:34,446
真の世界を
The true world

193
00:33:59,986 --> 00:34:04,546
黒い鉄格子の中で 私は生まれてきたんだ
Inside the black iron bars, I was born

194
00:34:05,126 --> 00:34:09,826
悪意の代償を願え 望むがままにお前に
Ask for the price of malice, exactly as you wish

195
00:34:10,326 --> 00:34:11,586
さあ与えよう
Come, I shall grant you

196
00:34:11,726 --> 00:34:14,126
正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Justice, destroying it before it is destroyed

197
00:34:14,286 --> 00:34:17,266
因果の代償を払い 共に行こう
Paying the price of cause and effect, let's go together

198
00:34:17,846 --> 00:34:20,926
報いよ 名もなき怪物
Recompense, O nameless monster

199
00:34:21,146 --> 00:34:24,186
黒い雨 降らせこの空
Black rain, pour upon this sky

200
00:34:24,346 --> 00:34:26,466
私は望まれないもの
I am an unwanted being

201
00:34:26,986 --> 00:34:29,946
ひび割れたノイローゼ 愛す
Loving the cracked neurosis

202
00:34:30,086 --> 00:34:32,266
同罪の傍観者達に さあ今
To the equally guilty bystanders, come now

203
00:34:32,426 --> 00:34:34,846
ふるえ正義を 壊して 壊される前に
Trembling justice, destroying it before it is destroyed

204
00:34:34,986 --> 00:34:37,526
因果の代償を払い 共に行こう
Paying the price of cause and effect, let's go together

205
00:34:41,846 --> 00:34:45,586
名前のない怪物
A nameless monster

206
00:35:33,380 --> 00:35:38,180
静寂に響いてよ My howling
Resound through the silence, My howling!

207
00:35:48,180 --> 00:35:53,180
滔々と流れていく風景
Scenery flowing on torrentially...

208
00:35:53,180 --> 00:35:59,180
刹那的な日々の中で
...within those fleeting days.

209
00:35:59,180 --> 00:36:04,180
差し伸べられた手は優しく
The hand extended to me was gentle,

210
00:36:04,180 --> 00:36:10,180
鼓動に滴る 微熱の予感
A slight fever of premonition dripping into my heartbeat.

211
00:36:10,180 --> 00:36:15,180
風に逆らう そう生きてきたから
Because I've lived going against the wind,

212
00:36:15,180 --> 00:36:21,180
君に会って気付く「もう独りじゃない」
Meeting you, I realized I'm no longer alone.

213
00:36:21,180 --> 00:36:27,180
赤光 瞬きは弧描き 月へ響く
Red light, blinking in an arc, echoing to the moon,

214
00:36:27,180 --> 00:36:32,180
爪弾く道 金瞳の群れ 共に嘆く夜
A plucked path, a pack of golden eyes, a night we lament together.

215
00:36:32,180 --> 00:36:39,180
慟哭 伝播する想いは 心強くする
Wailing, our broadcasting feelings make our hearts stronger.

216
00:36:39,180 --> 00:36:46,180
ついておいでよ うしろに君がいるから 私は迷わない 光射す道へ
Come along, because you're right behind me, I won't get lost, toward the path bathed in light.

217
00:36:55,180 --> 00:37:01,180
無力だから 仲間を求め 凍えるから
Because we are powerless, we seek companions; because we are freezing,

218
00:37:01,180 --> 00:37:06,180
火を灯して 変化とともに 進化していく
We light a fire and evolve together with change.

219
00:37:06,180 --> 00:37:12,180
この顛末は だれも知らない
No one knows how this will end.

220
00:37:12,180 --> 00:37:19,180
君を信じる そう決めているから
Because I've decided to believe in you,

221
00:37:19,180 --> 00:37:25,180
どんな異常非常も 乗り越えられるよ
I can overcome any anomaly or emergency.

222
00:37:25,180 --> 00:37:30,180
月光 この闇に唯一 凛と咲く華
Moonlight, blooming proudly and solely in this darkness.

223
00:37:30,180 --> 00:37:35,180
恐れなのか 憧れなのか 向かい合う夜空
Is it fear? Is it yearning? A night sky we face together.

224
00:37:35,180 --> 00:37:40,180
大地を駆け抜ける 私と君が創り出す
Created by you and me as we dash across the earth—

225
00:37:40,180 --> 00:37:46,180
この物語 単純な未来じゃない
This story is not a simple future;

226
00:37:46,180 --> 00:37:54,180
湧き立つ情熱 この声に乗せよう
Let's put our surging passion into this voice!

227
00:37:54,180 --> 00:38:02,180
空翔ぶ羽根なくても 手は繋げられたから
Even without wings to fly the skies, our hands were connected,

228
00:38:02,180 --> 00:38:12,180
この運命を選んだ 連動する遠吠えは静寂に響いて
And chose this fate. Our synchronizing howls echoed through the silence,

229
00:38:12,180 --> 00:38:19,180
何度も何度も その絆を確かめ合った
Time and time again, we confirmed that bond.

230
00:38:32,130 --> 00:38:41,680
ah 瞬きは弧描き 月へ響く 爪弾く道 金瞳の群れ 共に嘆く夜
Ah, blinking in an arc, echoing to the moon, a plucked path, a pack of golden eyes, a night we lament together...

231
00:38:41,680 --> 00:38:45,180
慟哭 伝播する想いは 心強くする
Wailing, our broadcasting feelings make our hearts stronger.

232
00:38:45,180 --> 00:38:51,680
ともにいこうよ うしろに君がいるから 私は迷わない
Let's go together, because you're right behind me, I won't get lost,

233
00:38:51,680 --> 00:38:56,180
光射す道へ
Toward the path bathed in light.

234
00:38:56,180 --> 00:39:09,180
Miss my melody... 狼が止まることはない
Miss my melody... The wolf will never stop.

235
00:39:31,180 --> 00:39:36,180
[Title: PSYCHO]

236
00:39:37,180 --> 00:39:40,180
Hey, unhappy world

237
00:39:40,180 --> 00:39:43,180
ようこそ楽園へ Into disorder 吸い込まれていく
Welcome to paradise, sucked into disorder...

238
00:39:43,180 --> 00:39:46,180
地球もそろそろ回り疲れて
The earth is getting tired of spinning soon,

239
00:39:46,180 --> 00:39:49,180
飽きちゃう ねぇ いつまで転がる？
Getting bored. Hey, how long will we keep rolling?

240
00:39:49,180 --> 00:39:53,180
輪廻転生 繰り返される営み
The workings of reincarnation repeated over and over,

241
00:39:53,180 --> 00:39:56,180
つまんない 整数と統制
Boring integers and control,

242
00:39:56,180 --> 00:39:59,180
奇と正をごちゃまぜ 混沌めしあがれ
Mix odd and even, eccentricity and order, and bon appétit to the chaos.

243
00:39:59,180 --> 00:40:02,161
悪意が僕をさ 魅了してやまない
Malice never fails to fascinate me.

244
00:40:02,385 --> 00:40:07,085
ガラスの靴だわ 履いたら綺麗ね 罪の重さで木っ端微塵
Glass slippers, aren't they pretty when you wear them? Smashed to pieces by the weight of sin.

245
00:40:07,185 --> 00:40:11,285
愛したいな 生かしたいな 壊したいな 殺めたいな 世界が僕らを嫌うなら
Wanting to love, wanting to keep alive, wanting to destroy, wanting to kill—if the world hates us.

246
00:40:11,585 --> 00:40:17,685
ああ...
Ah...

247
00:40:18,005 --> 00:40:22,005
左胸で踊り狂う臓器 今際にしがみついて昂る
The organs dancing wildly in my left chest, clinging to my dying moment and surging!

248
00:40:22,285 --> 00:40:26,085
赤い目しておどけさわぐ 残酷は天使のツラして
Making a fuss with red eyes, cruelty putting on an angel's face.

249
00:40:26,605 --> 00:40:30,605
憂いながら弄んだ 弱者敗者ふみつけて Psychoさぁ行こう
Toying with it sorrowfully. Stamping on the weak and losers, Psycho, let's go!

250
00:40:31,205 --> 00:40:37,205
ジャックシャッフル踏んで サイコサイコー！
Step to the jack shuffle, psycho psycho!

251
00:40:39,765 --> 00:40:43,665
ジャックシャッフル踏んで サイコサイコー！
Step to the jack shuffle, psycho psycho!

252
00:40:45,865 --> 00:40:50,165
治療してよ カルテはめちゃくちゃ 刺してホラ その細い針
Treat me, my chart is a mess. Pierce me, look, with that thin needle.

253
00:40:51,165 --> 00:40:56,365
"不可解"つたない落書きでも 純真無垢でしょ？ これがお好きでしょ？
Even if it's an 'incomprehensible' clumsy scribble, it's innocent, right? Is this what you like?

254
00:40:57,165 --> 00:41:00,065
毒に染まる愛 直情的な恋
Love dyed in poison, headstrong romance...

255
00:41:00,365 --> 00:41:02,965
僕はどこまでいけるのか
How far can I go?

256
00:41:03,465 --> 00:41:09,965
醜いな汚いな 美しいな素晴らしいな 時代よ僕を受けとめ あぁ
How unsightly, how filthy, how beautiful, how wonderful—era, accept me, ah...

257
00:41:09,965 --> 00:41:14,965
ああ...
Ah...

258
